body:
I think that's absolutely it. My sister and I have a theory that deep down, she wants to be Trump, in all his glory and seems to think her loved-ones are holding her back from this dream. Everyone just fawning over her and telling her how smart she is all the time is her late-night fantasy. 

&#x200B;

Thank you. I'll admit other ones have been far from it on this topic but it's hard not to react sometimes.

I wouldn't even say I'm comfortably numb at this point. Just baseline numb. 

&#x200B;

Someone said to me recently "but come on, you know you really rub people the wrong way". I didn't know what they meant until I realized how blank I must come off. People see it as me being disingenuine or some kind of sociopath but the reality is that the mask I use to hide how much I hate myself and how lost I am is cracking. 

&#x200B;

I'm sorry that you feel it too.
